# Last updated date (mousavi-site)

Whenever you change website content in this repository (HTML, CSS, JS, files linked from the site, etc.):

1. Update `SITE_LAST_UPDATED` in `assets/js/site.js` to today's date as `YYYY-MM-DD`.
2. Also update the visible fallback text and `datetime` on each page's `<time class="js-site-last-updated">` in the footer so it matches (same calendar day).

Do this in the same task before committing. Do not leave a stale last-updated date after content edits.
